                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "Came here for lunch after visiting 中正纪念堂.  We have three kids age 5, 8, 10. There’s a minimum spend of $100 per person but as long as three kids combine $300 is good enough. So we order curry pork rice, curry prawn rice, kids set tomato pasta, fries - it’s sufficient for us. Recommend to make reservation because it’s full after 12pm.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en"
                                 },
